          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Why does my Toshiba show a clear menu but no set-top box picture?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "The TV can produce an image, so the source device, selected input, HDMI lead and port are useful starting points. A hardware input fault remains possible; the menu comparison narrows the investigation."
